1
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:46,900
"The Missing Piece"

2
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:51,800
(Episode 11)

3
00:01:52,480 --> 00:01:53,480
You're awake.

4
00:01:53,760 --> 00:01:56,039
The test results show nothing serious.

5
00:01:56,040 --> 00:01:57,640
Just a mild concussion.

6
00:01:57,840 --> 00:02:00,200
Are you experiencing any other discomfort?

7
00:02:01,719 --> 00:02:03,120
A little dizzy.

8
00:02:03,200 --> 00:02:03,920
I see.

9
00:02:03,921 --> 00:02:05,319
Dizziness is normal.

10
00:02:05,480 --> 00:02:07,119
As long as you're not feeling too nauseous,

11
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,295
there's no major cause for concern.

12
00:02:08,319 --> 00:02:09,319
Just get some rest.

13
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:28,000
Doctor,

14
00:02:29,240 --> 00:02:31,800
my memory feels a bit hazy.

15
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:34,879
I can't remember anything
from the past six months.

16
00:02:35,520 --> 00:02:36,520
Your memory?

17
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:38,319
Judging from your scans,

18
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:41,439
the area responsible for
memory wasn't damaged.

19
00:02:42,080 --> 00:02:42,919
However,

20
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,800
the human brain is a mysterious thing.

21
00:02:45,240 --> 00:02:47,359
Severe physical trauma or emotional shock

22
00:02:47,360 --> 00:02:49,000
can indeed affect memory.

23
00:02:49,400 --> 00:02:51,240
It might come back after some rest.

24
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:54,680
Honestly, though,

25
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,360
in a case like yours,

26
00:02:56,560 --> 00:02:58,759
there isn't really a targeted
treatment right now.

27
00:03:08,319 --> 00:03:09,319
Shen Mo!

28
00:03:10,400 --> 00:03:10,800
Shen Mo!

29
00:03:11,199 --> 00:03:12,199
Open up!

30
00:03:15,879 --> 00:03:17,039
You're Shen Mo, right?

31
00:03:18,159 --> 00:03:19,159
Yes.

32
00:03:19,759 --> 00:03:21,119
I took pity on you back then,

33
00:03:21,120 --> 00:03:22,719
knowing fresh graduates have it rough,

34
00:03:22,759 --> 00:03:24,719
which is why I rented
this place to you so cheap.

35
00:03:24,960 --> 00:03:27,400
Look at how many months of rent you owe!

36
00:03:27,639 --> 00:03:29,199
You're taking advantage of my kindness!

37
00:03:34,360 --> 00:03:35,360
I'm so sorry.

38
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,359
I injured my hand a while ago

39
00:03:38,360 --> 00:03:39,760
and haven't been able to find work.

40
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:41,840
Could you give me a few more days, please?

41
00:03:42,159 --> 00:03:43,438
How much more leeway
do you expect me to give?

42
00:03:43,439 --> 00:03:44,439
Huh?

43
00:03:45,039 --> 00:03:46,535
Pack your things.
Get out.

44
00:03:46,559 --> 00:03:47,919
[He owes nearly 9000 yuan in rent]

45
00:03:48,280 --> 00:03:49,718
Please, give me a little more time.

46
00:03:49,719 --> 00:03:50,719
I can't move out.

47
00:03:50,719 --> 00:03:51,400
I still have to wait...

48
00:03:51,400 --> 00:03:52,319
Enough, enough!

49
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,400
Save your breath.

50
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:54,439
You have two days.

51
00:03:54,440 --> 00:03:55,879
Pack your things right now.

52
00:03:56,080 --> 00:03:58,056
In two days, I'm bringing
people over to take the place back.

53
00:03:58,080 --> 00:03:59,520
Hurry it up!

54
00:04:12,960 --> 00:04:13,960
Wait.

55
00:04:15,520 --> 00:04:16,240
What is it?

56
00:04:16,240 --> 00:04:17,240
Mr. Ji?

57
00:04:18,720 --> 00:04:19,759
Drive forward a bit.

58
00:04:23,399 --> 00:04:24,519
Stop right here.

59
00:04:55,040 --> 00:04:56,040
That was beautiful.

60
00:04:56,279 --> 00:04:58,439
Then how about I sing for
you every day from now on?

61
00:04:59,319 --> 00:05:00,319
Sounds good.

62
00:05:03,879 --> 00:05:04,879
Let's go.

63
00:05:11,600 --> 00:05:12,600
Stop.

64
00:05:26,079 --> 00:05:27,079
Shen Mo.

65
00:05:28,000 --> 00:05:29,000
I need to see you.

66
00:05:40,120 --> 00:05:41,120
Hello.

67
00:05:41,759 --> 00:05:42,759
Who are you?

68
00:05:48,720 --> 00:05:49,720
I'm sorry.

69
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:51,639
Wrong place.

70
00:05:51,920 --> 00:05:52,160
Oh.

71
00:05:52,439 --> 00:05:52,920
No problem.

72
00:05:53,120 --> 00:05:53,560
Uh,

73
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,360
do you know

74
00:05:54,361 --> 00:05:55,879
where the previous tenant went?

75
00:05:56,000 --> 00:05:57,120
Not sure.

76
00:05:57,199 --> 00:05:58,959
The landlord mentioned
something in passing,

77
00:05:59,560 --> 00:06:01,680
it sounded like he couldn't
pay rent and had to leave.

78
00:06:03,639 --> 00:06:04,639
I see.

79
00:06:32,040 --> 00:06:33,040
So,

80
00:06:33,439 --> 00:06:35,360
in the end, I'm still homeless.

81
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,720
Drop whatever you're doing.

82
00:06:48,439 --> 00:06:49,480
Find Shen Mo.

83
00:06:50,160 --> 00:06:51,160
Right now.

84
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:03,680
Yes.

85
00:07:03,920 --> 00:07:05,480
I majored in fine arts at T University.

86
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,040
I might not be able to paint right now,

87
00:07:09,600 --> 00:07:11,000
but I can do other things.

88
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,600
All right.

89
00:07:14,879 --> 00:07:15,879
Thank you anyway.

90
00:07:26,120 --> 00:07:27,120
Who is it?

91
00:07:36,439 --> 00:07:37,439
Mr. Ji?

92
00:07:38,160 --> 00:07:39,600
How did you know I lived here?

93
00:07:41,680 --> 00:07:42,680
You...

94
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,160
You remember who I am?

95
00:07:52,439 --> 00:07:53,920
You're Ji An'an's brother.

96
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:56,079
Back then,

97
00:07:56,560 --> 00:07:57,360
when I had the accident,

98
00:07:57,361 --> 00:07:59,040
didn't you pay my hospital bills?

99
00:07:59,480 --> 00:08:01,000
I really need to thank you for that.

100
00:08:01,600 --> 00:08:04,343
If it weren't for you, I wouldn't
have known how to pay for all that.

101
00:08:06,319 --> 00:08:07,040
Don't just stand there.

102
00:08:07,040 --> 00:08:08,040
Come in.

103
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:09,199
Please, come inside.

104
00:08:11,759 --> 00:08:13,079
Sorry about the place.

105
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,079
It's pretty run-down,

106
00:08:16,519 --> 00:08:17,519
and kind of a mess.

107
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:18,920
Here.

108
00:08:18,959 --> 00:08:19,959
Have a seat.

109
00:08:29,160 --> 00:08:30,800
How did you end up like this?

110
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:34,038
Well, with my hand injured,

111
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:35,559
I haven't been able to find a job.

112
00:08:36,000 --> 00:08:37,679
I fell way behind on rent,

113
00:08:38,159 --> 00:08:39,799
so I'm just crashing here for now.

114
00:08:46,759 --> 00:08:47,799
Take this for now.

115
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:50,480
No, no, I can't take this.

116
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,278
You already paid my hospital bills.

117
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:54,440
I'm already deeply in your debt.

118
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:56,080
If I take more money from you,

119
00:08:57,120 --> 00:08:58,360
I won't be able to pay it back,

120
00:08:58,559 --> 00:09:00,399
and I wouldn't have the nerve to face you.

121
00:09:01,240 --> 00:09:02,360
Just take it.

122
00:09:02,559 --> 00:09:03,759
You don't need to pay me back.

123
00:09:05,720 --> 00:09:06,399
Really, no.

124
00:09:06,399 --> 00:09:07,399
I mean it.

125
00:09:07,600 --> 00:09:08,600
I have two hands and two feet.

126
00:09:08,601 --> 00:09:09,761
I can make a living anywhere.

127
00:09:10,480 --> 00:09:12,080
Besides, this place is just temporary.

128
00:09:12,320 --> 00:09:13,320
It might look shabby,

129
00:09:13,720 --> 00:09:15,240
but it's actually not bad.

130
00:09:17,559 --> 00:09:18,919
Fine, if you don't want the money.

131
00:09:20,519 --> 00:09:21,519
How about this?

132
00:09:21,639 --> 00:09:23,159
Pack your things and come with me.

133
00:09:23,879 --> 00:09:25,240
I'll find you a place to stay.

134
00:09:25,320 --> 00:09:27,320
You can move out once
you're back on your feet.

135
00:09:27,960 --> 00:09:29,359
I appreciate the thought, Mr. Ji.

136
00:09:29,360 --> 00:09:30,360
Truly.

137
00:09:31,120 --> 00:09:33,480
Although I don't know
why you're being so kind to me,

138
00:09:34,519 --> 00:09:36,679
I really can't accept this.

139
00:09:38,360 --> 00:09:39,840
Thank you anyway, Mr. Ji.

140
00:09:42,399 --> 00:09:43,399
I see.

141
00:09:44,639 --> 00:09:45,639
I understand.

142
00:09:52,200 --> 00:09:53,480
What if I offer you a job?

143
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:56,240
Not charity,

144
00:09:56,440 --> 00:09:57,799
and not an ordinary job, either.

145
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,480
Would you take it?

146
00:10:02,399 --> 00:10:03,399
What?

147
00:10:32,799 --> 00:10:34,480
Is this the power of the Ji family?

148
00:10:40,600 --> 00:10:41,600
Take a look.

149
00:10:43,440 --> 00:10:44,440
What's this?

150
00:10:45,840 --> 00:10:47,000
Be my lover.

151
00:10:49,759 --> 00:10:50,759
What?

152
00:10:52,879 --> 00:10:54,399
Be my lover under contract.

153
00:10:55,200 --> 00:10:56,879
The agreement is in your hands.

154
00:11:04,840 --> 00:11:05,840
Me?

155
00:11:07,080 --> 00:11:08,240
A contract lover?

156
00:11:09,480 --> 00:11:11,120
You and Zhou Yang have a past.

157
00:11:12,200 --> 00:11:13,320
I don't trust you,

158
00:11:14,200 --> 00:11:15,399
and I don't trust Zhou Yang.

159
00:11:17,200 --> 00:11:18,719
To make sure Zhou Yang commits

160
00:11:18,720 --> 00:11:20,120
fully to my sister,

161
00:11:20,360 --> 00:11:21,520
and gives up on you for good,

162
00:11:22,360 --> 00:11:24,360
the best way is to keep an eye on you.

163
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,759
And the best way to keep an eye on you

164
00:11:28,720 --> 00:11:32,759
is to keep you tied to my
side by making you my lover.

165
00:11:33,440 --> 00:11:34,680
At the same time, I can use you

166
00:11:35,399 --> 00:11:36,399
to fend off some of those

167
00:11:36,400 --> 00:11:37,919
pointless advances from others.

168
00:11:38,840 --> 00:11:39,919
Everyone wins.

169
00:11:39,960 --> 00:11:40,759
This...

170
00:11:40,760 --> 00:11:42,000
isn't right, is it?

171
00:11:42,559 --> 00:11:43,799
Do you have an issue with that?

172
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:47,320
You won't be shortchanged.

173
00:11:47,720 --> 00:11:49,320
It's all clearly stated in the contract.

174
00:11:50,080 --> 00:11:51,160
If you have any conditions,

175
00:11:51,600 --> 00:11:52,600
feel free to name them.

176
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:55,399
That's not what I meant.

177
00:11:55,720 --> 00:11:56,960
Then what do you mean?

178
00:11:58,120 --> 00:11:59,840
I was already indebted to Mr. Ji.

179
00:12:00,600 --> 00:12:03,080
He just wants to protect
his sister's happiness this way.

180
00:12:03,559 --> 00:12:04,559
And me?

181
00:12:05,200 --> 00:12:07,159
I'm just a useless, homeless nobody.

182
00:12:07,720 --> 00:12:09,399
What right do I have to refuse?

183
00:12:10,440 --> 00:12:11,519
Besides,

184
00:12:12,279 --> 00:12:13,279
Zhou Yang...

185
00:12:18,600 --> 00:12:19,600
Fine.

186
00:12:20,679 --> 00:12:22,240
Since I'm the one who's in the way,

187
00:12:23,200 --> 00:12:25,080
I might as well sell
myself for a decent price.

188
00:12:40,679 --> 00:12:42,679
Starting today, you'll live here.

189
00:12:43,120 --> 00:12:44,600
You can pick whichever room you want.

190
00:12:45,320 --> 00:12:46,559
Once you've chosen,

191
00:12:47,440 --> 00:12:48,720
go take a shower.

192
00:13:15,000 --> 00:13:16,159
This "lover" title...

193
00:13:16,639 --> 00:13:17,840
it's just in name, right?

194
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:20,560
Mr. Ji wouldn't actually do
anything to me, would he?

195
00:13:20,960 --> 00:13:23,480
Probably not. He definitely
wouldn't be interested in me anyway.

196
00:13:23,919 --> 00:13:24,559
Still,

197
00:13:24,759 --> 00:13:26,080
if he wants it,

198
00:13:26,399 --> 00:13:27,919
can I even say no?

199
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,840
After all, I signed the contract.

200
00:13:30,159 --> 00:13:31,279
My body...

201
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,759
must be included

202
00:13:32,919 --> 00:13:34,399
in this lover agreement, right?

203
00:13:40,519 --> 00:13:41,519
Come here.

204
00:13:48,639 --> 00:13:49,720
Take off your clothes.

205
00:14:34,960 --> 00:14:36,640
You didn't even dry yourself off properly.

206
00:14:58,159 --> 00:14:59,519
We signed a contract, didn't we?

207
00:15:03,120 --> 00:15:04,879
That makes us lovers now, doesn't it?

208
00:15:08,080 --> 00:15:09,080
Yes.

209
00:15:19,120 --> 00:15:20,120
Take them off.

210
00:15:30,320 --> 00:15:31,320
Say my name.

211
00:15:34,600 --> 00:15:35,600
Mr. Ji...

212
00:15:36,679 --> 00:15:37,799
Call me Mingxuan.

213
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:40,960
Mingxuan.

214
00:15:41,600 --> 00:15:42,600
Louder.

215
00:15:48,360 --> 00:15:49,360
Mingxuan.

216
00:15:55,919 --> 00:15:56,960
Mingxuan.

217
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:23,000
Mr. Ji has so much experience.

218
00:16:23,480 --> 00:16:24,775
He must be completely unimpressed

219
00:16:24,799 --> 00:16:26,039
by such a terrible performance.

220
00:16:26,559 --> 00:16:27,159
Sigh.

221
00:16:27,160 --> 00:16:28,279
Shen Mo, oh, Shen Mo...

222
00:16:29,039 --> 00:16:31,599
You aren't even good enough for
him to use you to blow off steam.

223
00:16:41,039 --> 00:16:42,039
Mr. Ji,

224
00:16:42,279 --> 00:16:43,279
breakfast is ready.

225
00:16:44,279 --> 00:16:45,440
I'll skip breakfast.

226
00:16:46,159 --> 00:16:47,559
I have an urgent meeting to attend.

227
00:16:51,960 --> 00:16:52,960
Open it.

228
00:16:53,559 --> 00:16:54,559
This is...

229
00:16:56,480 --> 00:16:57,879
A ring I had my secretary buy.

230
00:16:58,039 --> 00:17:00,199
If we're putting on an act,
we have to do it properly.

231
00:17:04,079 --> 00:17:06,039
Who knew Mr. Ji could be a liar too?

232
00:17:06,319 --> 00:17:08,079
Anyone can tell this ring isn't new.

233
00:17:08,759 --> 00:17:10,240
A wealthy CEO like him,

234
00:17:10,839 --> 00:17:12,559
and he can't even splurge on a new ring?

235
00:17:14,319 --> 00:17:15,319
I'm off to work.

236
00:17:23,680 --> 00:17:25,319
Why does it fit so well, though?

237
00:17:29,579 --> 00:17:34,039
[Four years later]

238
00:17:54,440 --> 00:17:55,640
Ever since An'an's accident,

239
00:17:56,400 --> 00:17:58,359
Mr. Ji has been gone for four years.

240
00:17:59,000 --> 00:18:00,000
The irony is,

241
00:18:00,359 --> 00:18:02,599
I spent three years as his contract lover,

242
00:18:03,160 --> 00:18:04,599
yet only on the day he left,

243
00:18:05,279 --> 00:18:08,119
at Jinxiu Villa, did I remember everything.

244
00:18:45,400 --> 00:18:46,400
Boss,

245
00:18:46,440 --> 00:18:47,799
slacking off again?

246
00:18:52,920 --> 00:18:53,960
Sorry about that.

247
00:18:54,279 --> 00:18:55,279
I'm late getting back.

248
00:18:55,680 --> 00:18:57,758
I didn't make you late
for your date, did I?

249
00:18:57,759 --> 00:18:58,759
Hmph.

250
00:18:58,920 --> 00:19:01,239
I can never tell which
one of us is the boss.

251
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:03,359
I swear I care more about
this studio than you do.

252
00:19:03,720 --> 00:19:04,720
Look at that.

253
00:19:05,240 --> 00:19:06,559
You're not wrong.

254
00:19:07,720 --> 00:19:09,839
You're practically a veteran employee now.

255
00:19:10,599 --> 00:19:12,799
Four years... it flew by like nothing.

256
00:19:13,000 --> 00:19:14,000
Exactly.

257
00:19:14,119 --> 00:19:16,640
I've been here since the studio opened.

258
00:19:16,920 --> 00:19:18,679
I came here looking for
some peace and quiet,

259
00:19:18,680 --> 00:19:20,599
but I didn't expect it to be this dead.

260
00:19:21,880 --> 00:19:23,119
Then again,

261
00:19:23,680 --> 00:19:24,960
it's been four years,

262
00:19:25,079 --> 00:19:26,880
and I've never once seen you date anyone.

263
00:19:27,440 --> 00:19:28,240
Boss,

264
00:19:28,319 --> 00:19:29,959
you're already thirty.

265
00:19:29,960 --> 00:19:31,358
Time to get back out there!

266
00:19:31,359 --> 00:19:33,399
I won't even be twenty-nine
until after New Year's.

267
00:19:33,640 --> 00:19:35,079
Same difference!

268
00:19:35,599 --> 00:19:36,599
Let me tell you,

269
00:19:37,079 --> 00:19:38,239
the older you get,

270
00:19:38,240 --> 00:19:40,279
the harder it is on the dating market.

271
00:19:40,920 --> 00:19:41,519
Pfft.

272
00:19:41,799 --> 00:19:43,480
Where did you pick up all that nonsense?

273
00:19:43,799 --> 00:19:44,480
Come on.

274
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:45,200
Seriously, though,

275
00:19:45,200 --> 00:19:45,880
Boss,

276
00:19:46,000 --> 00:19:47,519
do you want me to set you up?

277
00:19:48,137 --> 00:19:49,295
I actually have a college classmate...

278
00:19:49,319 --> 00:19:50,000
Stop right there.

279
00:19:50,160 --> 00:19:50,960
No thanks.

280
00:19:51,119 --> 00:19:51,920
I'm good.

281
00:19:52,119 --> 00:19:53,119
What?

282
00:19:53,160 --> 00:19:56,519
Boss... there's someone
in your heart, isn't there?

283
00:19:57,039 --> 00:19:58,559
Waiting in silence,

284
00:19:58,799 --> 00:19:59,720
brokenhearted,

285
00:19:59,721 --> 00:20:01,240
and locking your heart away forever.

286
00:20:02,279 --> 00:20:03,640
Was it your first love?

287
00:20:04,480 --> 00:20:04,720
Or...

288
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:06,039
a secret crush?

289
00:20:06,319 --> 00:20:07,119
Oh!

290
00:20:07,319 --> 00:20:09,079
The dream girl you spent years chasing?

291
00:20:09,559 --> 00:20:10,359
Neither.

292
00:20:10,440 --> 00:20:11,480
Stop making things up.

293
00:20:16,200 --> 00:20:17,200
Boss,

294
00:20:17,279 --> 00:20:18,480
my ride is here.

295
00:20:18,599 --> 00:20:19,319
I'm heading out!

296
00:20:19,440 --> 00:20:19,759
Bye-bye!

297
00:20:19,759 --> 00:20:20,759
Get out of here.

298
00:20:22,400 --> 00:20:23,400
Boss!

299
00:20:23,440 --> 00:20:24,518
I know

300
00:20:24,519 --> 00:20:26,480
you'll win over the one you love!

301
00:20:27,160 --> 00:20:28,160
Good luck!

302
00:20:45,880 --> 00:20:47,960
I painted so many pieces over those years.

303
00:20:48,440 --> 00:20:50,599
And to collect every single one of them,

304
00:20:51,160 --> 00:20:52,760
that person went through so much effort.

305
00:21:20,880 --> 00:21:22,239
I'm heading out of town next week.

306
00:21:22,240 --> 00:21:23,720
I'm leaving the studio in your hands.

307
00:21:24,960 --> 00:21:25,759
Boss,

308
00:21:25,960 --> 00:21:27,640
you're going on another trip?

309
00:21:28,160 --> 00:21:30,038
You get to travel every
year around this time.

310
00:21:30,039 --> 00:21:31,160
I'm so jealous.

311
00:21:31,599 --> 00:21:32,599
It's not just for fun.

312
00:21:32,960 --> 00:21:34,559
I'm going to look for inspiration.

313
00:21:34,759 --> 00:21:37,119
Inspiration is everything to an artist.

314
00:21:37,799 --> 00:21:40,999
Then when are you going to let
me find some inspiration, too?

315
00:21:41,023 --> 00:21:42,141
My dearest Boss?

316
00:21:42,559 --> 00:21:43,359
All right.

317
00:21:43,400 --> 00:21:45,118
When I get back, you
can take your annual leave.

318
00:21:45,119 --> 00:21:46,119
Deal?

319
00:21:46,519 --> 00:21:47,000
Really?

320
00:21:47,200 --> 00:21:48,359
It's a promise, then!

321
00:21:49,559 --> 00:21:50,519
Dearest Boss,

322
00:21:50,559 --> 00:21:52,159
where are you heading for fun this time?

323
00:21:52,720 --> 00:21:54,240
Where are you hunting for inspiration?

324
00:21:55,680 --> 00:21:56,680
The usual spot.

325
00:21:58,279 --> 00:21:59,440
M Island again?

326
00:22:00,799 --> 00:22:02,838
That's a honeymoon hotspot!

327
00:22:02,839 --> 00:22:05,239
Only couples go there together.

328
00:22:05,240 --> 00:22:05,799
Seriously.

329
00:22:05,799 --> 00:22:06,440
You,

330
00:22:06,441 --> 00:22:08,119
a certified perpetual bachelor,

331
00:22:08,279 --> 00:22:10,359
why do you go there year after year?

332
00:22:11,680 --> 00:22:12,640
Hoping for a fling?

333
00:22:12,641 --> 00:22:14,121
Or trying to steal someone's partner?

334
00:22:15,160 --> 00:22:16,318
What on earth goes on

335
00:22:16,319 --> 00:22:17,799
inside that head of yours?

336
00:22:17,839 --> 00:22:19,680
I told you, I'm going for inspiration.

337
00:22:20,400 --> 00:22:21,400
Hmph.

338
00:22:21,880 --> 00:22:23,879
Going there every year
at the start of spring...

339
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:26,038
I don't buy that there's no special reason.

340
00:22:26,039 --> 00:22:27,439
What special reason could there be?

341
00:22:27,519 --> 00:22:29,159
Spring is the season of new beginnings.

342
00:22:29,160 --> 00:22:30,838
Everything comes back to life in spring.

343
00:22:30,839 --> 00:22:31,640
Ha!

344
00:22:31,839 --> 00:22:32,999
It's the best time to travel.

345
00:22:33,559 --> 00:22:36,079
"Spring is the season of new beginnings"?

346
00:22:36,559 --> 00:22:37,359
Boss,

347
00:22:37,559 --> 00:22:39,279
looks to me like you're in heat.

348
00:22:39,440 --> 00:22:40,440
Hehe.

349
00:22:42,440 --> 00:22:44,839
Looks to me like you
don't want your paycheck.

350
00:22:45,160 --> 00:22:46,399
I'm sorry, I'm sorry, I'm sorry!

351
00:22:46,400 --> 00:22:47,400
Sorry, Boss!

352
00:22:47,519 --> 00:22:48,920
Have mercy on me!

353
00:22:49,359 --> 00:22:50,160
Be the bigger person!

354
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:50,799
Shoo.

355
00:22:51,079 --> 00:22:52,079
Get back to work.

356
00:22:52,319 --> 00:22:53,319
Slave driver.

357
00:23:00,519 --> 00:23:01,519
Four years.

358
00:23:02,200 --> 00:23:04,279
Days slipped by, one after another.

359
00:23:05,319 --> 00:23:06,598
I used to long so much

360
00:23:06,599 --> 00:23:07,920
for a life like this.

361
00:23:21,720 --> 00:23:23,319
Four years ago, right around this time,

362
00:23:23,759 --> 00:23:25,079
if none of that had happened,

363
00:23:26,146 --> 00:23:28,466
Ji Mingxuan and I would
have gone to M Island together.

364
00:23:30,839 --> 00:23:32,599
Maybe we were just never meant to be.

365
00:23:49,200 --> 00:23:50,200
This way, please.

366
00:23:52,319 --> 00:23:53,839
Welcome to SEAMO Hotel.

367
00:23:53,880 --> 00:23:54,960
Here is your room.

368
00:23:55,480 --> 00:23:58,239
Our investor is also of Chinese descent,

369
00:23:58,240 --> 00:24:00,518
so throughout the overall design,

370
00:24:00,519 --> 00:24:02,159
you'll find many of his personal touches.

371
00:24:02,400 --> 00:24:04,359
We hope it makes you feel right at home.

372
00:24:04,759 --> 00:24:06,079
If you need anything,

373
00:24:06,119 --> 00:24:07,295
please feel free to reach out.

374
00:24:07,319 --> 00:24:08,400
Enjoy your stay.

375
00:24:09,359 --> 00:24:10,160
Thank you.

376
00:24:10,200 --> 00:24:11,200
You're welcome.

377
00:24:48,039 --> 00:24:49,039
Mr. Ji...

378
00:24:49,839 --> 00:24:50,839
Where are you?

379
00:24:52,079 --> 00:24:53,839
Where are you looking
at the moon right now?

380
00:25:13,440 --> 00:25:14,440
Mingxuan!

381
00:25:16,480 --> 00:25:17,920
Mingxuan, come here, quick!

382
00:25:20,880 --> 00:25:21,880
Coming!

383
00:25:26,240 --> 00:25:27,240
Let's go over there.

384
00:25:27,359 --> 00:25:28,359
Okay.

385
00:25:31,559 --> 00:25:33,440
I wonder how Ji Mingxuan is doing now.

386
00:25:33,920 --> 00:25:35,079
Has he changed at all?

387
00:25:36,720 --> 00:25:37,720
Then again,

388
00:25:37,799 --> 00:25:39,839
I'll probably never see
him again in this lifetime.

389
00:25:52,400 --> 00:25:53,720
I'm so sorry, I'm so sorry!

390
00:25:55,839 --> 00:25:56,960
I'm so sorry!

391
00:25:57,400 --> 00:25:58,400
Sorry.

392
00:26:02,200 --> 00:26:03,200
Mr. Ji...

393
00:26:04,960 --> 00:26:05,960
Come with me.

394
00:26:25,079 --> 00:26:26,079
Mr. Ji, that's enough.

395
00:26:29,759 --> 00:26:30,759
Rinse it a bit longer.

396
00:26:41,920 --> 00:26:42,920
You haven't changed much.

397
00:26:45,880 --> 00:26:47,119
Neither have you, Mr. Ji.

398
00:27:01,640 --> 00:27:02,960
Go wait in my room.

399
00:27:03,680 --> 00:27:04,720
I'll go get some ointment.

400
00:27:40,319 --> 00:27:41,479
Here on M Island on vacation?

401
00:27:44,519 --> 00:27:46,200
I started painting again.

402
00:27:46,480 --> 00:27:47,840
Just came looking for inspiration.

403
00:27:54,319 --> 00:27:55,359
Did you come alone?

404
00:27:56,839 --> 00:27:57,839
Yeah.

405
00:27:59,119 --> 00:28:00,440
I'm the only one with free time.

406
00:28:01,880 --> 00:28:02,880
When did you get in?

407
00:28:03,440 --> 00:28:04,440
A few days ago.

408
00:28:05,079 --> 00:28:06,079
What about you?

409
00:28:07,240 --> 00:28:08,320
I've been here for a while.

410
00:28:16,480 --> 00:28:17,480
All done.

411
00:28:18,079 --> 00:28:19,079
Thanks.

412
00:28:23,200 --> 00:28:24,200
Young Master.

413
00:28:24,680 --> 00:28:25,720
Daddy!

414
00:28:27,400 --> 00:28:28,440
Speak Chinese.

415
00:28:28,640 --> 00:28:29,640
Baba!

416
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:31,599
Come here.

417
00:28:31,880 --> 00:28:33,279
Say hello to Uncle Shen.

418
00:28:33,480 --> 00:28:34,559
Hello, Uncle.

419
00:28:38,160 --> 00:28:39,240
Hello there.

420
00:28:39,720 --> 00:28:40,720
What's your name?

421
00:28:41,000 --> 00:28:41,519
Ning.

422
00:28:41,640 --> 00:28:42,640
Ji Ning.

423
00:28:46,440 --> 00:28:47,440
Hello, Xiao Ning.

424
00:28:47,480 --> 00:28:48,759
How old are you?

425
00:28:50,519 --> 00:28:51,519
Three years old.

426
00:28:53,599 --> 00:28:55,039
Uncle, play with me!

427
00:28:56,279 --> 00:28:56,799
Be good.

428
00:28:57,079 --> 00:28:58,640
Uncle's hand is hurt.

429
00:29:00,640 --> 00:29:01,640
Sister Chen,

430
00:29:03,119 --> 00:29:03,920
Young Master,

431
00:29:04,000 --> 00:29:05,000
let's go play outside.

432
00:29:08,400 --> 00:29:09,400
Unc...

433
00:29:09,480 --> 00:29:10,799
Bye-bye, Uncle!

434
00:29:14,000 --> 00:29:14,599
Oh...

435
00:29:14,960 --> 00:29:16,640
Are you here on vacation too, Mr. Ji?

436
00:29:23,039 --> 00:29:24,079
Here on business.

437
00:29:25,720 --> 00:29:27,136
There's no one to look after Ji Ning,

438
00:29:27,160 --> 00:29:28,359
so I brought him along.

439
00:29:28,839 --> 00:29:29,839
I see.

440
00:29:30,759 --> 00:29:32,920
I didn't know you got married, Mr. Ji.

441
00:29:34,039 --> 00:29:35,039
Congratulations.

442
00:29:44,279 --> 00:29:45,279
And you?

443
00:29:49,559 --> 00:29:51,359
Did you and Zhou Yang
ever get back together?

444
00:29:54,359 --> 00:29:56,279
We haven't seen each other in years.

445
00:29:58,720 --> 00:29:59,000
I see.

446
00:29:59,000 --> 00:29:59,440
When are you??

447
00:29:59,440 --> 00:30:00,440
I thought...

448
00:30:00,960 --> 00:30:01,960
Daddy!

449
00:30:05,599 --> 00:30:06,640
It's getting late.

450
00:30:07,039 --> 00:30:08,400
I should head back.

451
00:30:08,559 --> 00:30:09,839
You should go tend to your son.

452
00:30:10,119 --> 00:30:11,119
Go back to your room.

453
00:30:14,079 --> 00:30:15,400
Let's have dinner tonight.

454
00:30:18,359 --> 00:30:19,759
I paint in the evenings.

455
00:30:19,839 --> 00:30:21,719
When inspiration strikes,
I hate interruptions.

456
00:30:22,640 --> 00:30:23,640
Tomorrow, then.

457
00:30:25,039 --> 00:30:26,039
Okay.

458
00:30:26,079 --> 00:30:27,119
We'll talk tomorrow.

459
00:30:32,240 --> 00:30:33,240
Thank you.

460
00:30:59,880 --> 00:31:01,078
Mr. Ji asked me to give this to you.

461
00:31:01,079 --> 00:31:03,159
He specifically reminded
you to change the dressing.

462
00:31:03,400 --> 00:31:04,400
Oh.

463
00:31:05,240 --> 00:31:06,240
Thank you.

464
00:31:14,673 --> 00:31:16,753
[Use once every 2 hours
until the swelling goes away]

465
00:31:19,240 --> 00:31:22,119
Mr. Ji... hasn't changed a bit.

466
00:31:44,440 --> 00:31:45,440
Daddy...

467
00:31:45,720 --> 00:31:48,759
Why aren't you asleep yet?

468
00:31:49,200 --> 00:31:49,440
Come here.

469
00:31:49,640 --> 00:31:50,640
Xiao Ning,

470
00:32:01,759 --> 00:32:03,359
Daddy was just thinking about

471
00:32:03,960 --> 00:32:05,680
someone I've known for a very long time.

472
00:32:06,039 --> 00:32:09,319
Do you miss them, Daddy?

473
00:32:12,920 --> 00:32:13,960
Whether I do or not,

474
00:32:14,480 --> 00:32:16,160
it's all in the past now.

475
00:32:18,720 --> 00:32:19,720
Xiao Ning,

476
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:21,160
time for bed.

477
00:32:21,519 --> 00:32:22,519
Good boy.

478
00:32:22,680 --> 00:32:23,680
Okay.

479
00:33:06,000 --> 00:33:07,000
Ji Mingxuan...

480
00:33:30,519 --> 00:33:32,640
I once held that man's heart,

481
00:33:33,319 --> 00:33:35,119
yet in the end, I let go.

482
00:33:36,400 --> 00:33:39,400
If only I'd remembered what happened
during those six months sooner,

483
00:33:40,079 --> 00:33:41,440
would things be different now?

484
00:33:44,519 --> 00:33:45,519
Forget it.

485
00:33:45,599 --> 00:33:47,680
Some people and some things...

486
00:33:48,319 --> 00:33:49,999
Once you let them slip away, they're gone.

487
00:34:04,839 --> 00:34:05,079
Hello?

488
00:34:05,160 --> 00:34:06,160
Yang Yue.

489
00:34:06,640 --> 00:34:07,640
What's up, Boss?

490
00:34:07,664 --> 00:34:08,864
Calling me this early...

491
00:34:09,000 --> 00:34:10,000
what can I do for you?

492
00:34:12,599 --> 00:34:13,999
I forgot about the time difference.

493
00:34:14,719 --> 00:34:15,759
Could you book a ticket for me?

494
00:34:15,760 --> 00:34:16,920
I'm heading back.

495
00:34:17,519 --> 00:34:18,960
Make sure you tidy up the studio.

496
00:34:19,360 --> 00:34:20,360
Huh?

497
00:34:20,599 --> 00:34:22,280
Why the early return?

498
00:34:23,039 --> 00:34:24,599
There's no point in staying any longer.

499
00:34:24,800 --> 00:34:25,800
Wait,

500
00:34:25,880 --> 00:34:26,880
did something happen

501
00:34:26,880 --> 00:34:27,880
to upset you?

502
00:34:29,719 --> 00:34:30,719
No.

503
00:34:32,920 --> 00:34:33,920
Quite the opposite.

504
00:34:35,079 --> 00:34:36,519
I'm too happy.

505
00:34:37,320 --> 00:34:38,320
So,

506
00:34:39,079 --> 00:34:40,159
this is enough.
